1}},{"type":"data","data":[{"first":1,"second":65,"attributeRules":116,"libraries":119},{"name":2,"intro":3,"touse":4,"nottouse":5,"logo":6,"attributes":7,"key":64},"Radix","Radix UI is a low-level UI component library that provides a set of unstyled and accessible building blocks for creating custom user interfaces in React applications. It focuses on providing the primitives and patterns for building accessible and composable UI components.","Use Radix UI when you want full control over the styling and behavior of your UI components and prefer to build your own design system from scratch. It's suitable for projects where you need a high degree of customization and want to prioritize accessibility.","Avoid Radix UI if you prefer a component library with pre-built themes and styles that require minimal customization. Also, if you're not comfortable with building your own design system and handling accessibility concerns, Radix UI might not be the best choice.","\u003Csvg viewBox=\"0 0 76 24\" fill=\"currentcolor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\u003Cpath d=\"M43.9022 20.0061H46.4499C46.2647 19.0375 46.17 18.1161 46.17 17.0058V12.3753C46.17 9.25687 44.3893 7.72127 41.1943 7.72127C38.3003 7.72127 36.3324 9.23324 36.0777 11.8083H38.9254C39.0181 10.698 39.8052 9.96561 41.1017 9.96561C42.4446 9.96561 43.3243 10.6743 43.3243 12.1391V12.7061L39.8052 13.1077C37.4206 13.3912 35.5684 14.3834 35.5684 16.7931C35.5684 18.9666 37.2353 20.2659 39.5274 20.2659C41.4027 20.2659 42.9845 19.4863 43.6401 18.1161C43.6689 18.937 43.9022 20.0061 43.9022 20.0061ZM40.3377 18.1634C39.157 18.1634 38.5087 17.5727 38.5087 16.6278C38.5087 15.3757 39.4579 15.0922 40.7082 14.9268L43.3243 14.6197V15.352C43.3243 17.242 41.8658 18.1634 40.3377 18.1634ZM56.2588 20.0061H59.176V3H56.2125V9.96561C55.6569 8.76075 54.3141 7.72127 52.4851 7.72127C49.3058 7.72127 47.099 10.2963 47.099 14.0054C47.099 17.7381 49.3058 20.2896 52.4851 20.2896C54.2678 20.2896 55.68 19.2973 56.2588 18.0925V20.0061ZM56.282 14.218C56.282 16.5569 55.1938 18.0689 53.3185 18.0689C51.3969 18.0689 50.1856 16.486 50.1856 14.0054C50.1856 11.5485 51.3969 9.94198 53.3185 9.94198C55.1938 9.94198 56.282 11.454 56.282 13.7928V14.218ZM60.9066 5.97304H64.0553V3.01996H60.9066V5.97304ZM60.9992 20.0061H63.9627V8.00476H60.9992V20.0061ZM67.6638 20.0061L70.6041 15.8954L73.5212 20.0061H76.9246L72.3636 13.7219L76.5542 8.00476H73.3823L70.7661 11.7138L68.1731 8.00476H64.7697L69.0066 13.8637L64.4919 20.0061H67.6638Z\">\u003C/path>\u003Cpath fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M24.9132 20V14.0168H28.7986L32.4513 20H35.7006L31.6894 13.5686C33.5045 12.986 35.0955 11.507 35.0955 9.01961C35.0955 5.7479 32.7994 4 28.9571 4H22V20H24.9132ZM24.9132 6.35294V11.6863H28.821C31.0395 11.6863 32.1599 10.7675 32.1599 9.01961C32.1599 7.27171 30.9395 6.35294 28.621 6.35294H24.9132Z\">\u003C/path>\u003Cpath d=\"M7 23C3.13401 23 0 19.6422 0 15.5C0 11.3578 3.13401 8 7 8V23Z\">\u003C/path>\u003Cpath d=\"M7 0H0V7H7V0Z\">\u003C/path>\u003Cpath d=\"M11.5 7C13.433 7 15 5.433 15 3.5C15 1.567 13.433 0 11.5 0C9.56704 0 8 1.567 8 3.5C8 5.433 9.56704 7 11.5 7Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\n",{"License":8,"Frameworks":11,"Unique components":15,"Built-in Themes":18,"Supports more than two themes":21,"JavaScript size":24,"Dependencies":27,"Dependency size":30,"GitHub stars":33,"Used by open source projects":35,"NPM downloads":38,"CDN":41,"Semantic class names":43,"Global customizations":45,"works without Node.js":47,"No-build version":49,"P3 colors":51,"RTL support":55,"Runtime CSS customization":57,"Native CSS nesting":59,"Open GitHub issues":61},{"value":9,"desc":10},"MIT","Open source MIT License",{"value":12,"positive":13,"desc":14},"Only React",false,"Radix Themes only works with React",{"value":16,"desc":17},28,"Radix Themes has 37 components, 28 of them are unique – for example radio and radio group are considered as same.",{"value":19,"desc":20},2,"Radix has 2 themes, colors are customizable but either for light or dark themes.",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":23},"No","Does not support more than 2 themes at the same time",{"value":25,"positive":13,"desc":26},"284kB","Imported JavaScript bundle size (minified)",{"value":28,"positive":13,"desc":29},72,"Radix Themes has 72 third-party dependencies. Using more third-party dependencies increases the risk of security vulnerabilities, compatibility problems, and long-term maintenance headaches from deprecated packages.",{"value":31,"positive":13,"desc":32},"11.9MB",null,{"value":34,"desc":32},8500,{"value":36,"desc":37},"?","No data available",{"value":39,"desc":40},681000,"Weekly downloads from NPM",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":42},"Radix Themes CSS file is not available on CDN",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":44},"Radix Themes does not use semantic CSS class names. Using semantic and descriptive CSS class names improves readability and maintainability of code independent of the current framework.",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":46},"Radix Themes requires changing JavaScript props one by one at build time to do design token customization",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":48},"Radix Themes requires a Node.js environment",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":50},"Radix Themes does not provide micro CSS files for each component",{"value":52,"positive":53,"desc":54},"Yes",true,"Radix Themes uses wide-gamut P3 colors",{"value":52,"positive":53,"desc":56},"Radix Themes supports right-to-left (RTL) layouts",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":58},"Radix Themes customizations requires changing JavaScript props at build time",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":60},"Radix Themes doesn not use native CSS nesting",{"value":62,"desc":63},153,"As of June 2026","radix",{"name":66,"intro":67,"touse":68,"nottouse":69,"logo":70,"attributes":71,"key":115},"HyperUI","HyperUI is a collection of free, open-source UI components built with Tailwind CSS. It provides a set of basic components and templates that can be used to quickly prototype and build web interfaces.","Use HyperUI when you need a simple and lightweight set of UI components for your Tailwind CSS project. It's suitable for projects where you want to quickly prototype or build basic UI elements without relying on a large component library.","Avoid HyperUI if you require a component library with a wide range of advanced components or extensive customization options. Also, if you prefer a component library with built-in theming capabilities, HyperUI might not be the best choice.","\u003Cdiv class=\"h-full w-full text-2xl lg:text-5xl flex items-center justify-center\">🚀\u003C/div>",{"License":72,"Frameworks":73,"Unique components":76,"Built-in Themes":79,"Supports more than two themes":81,"JavaScript size":82,"Dependencies":85,"Dependency size":88,"GitHub stars":90,"Used by open source projects":92,"NPM downloads":94,"CDN":95,"Semantic class names":97,"Global customizations":99,"works without Node.js":101,"No-build version":103,"P3 colors":105,"RTL support":107,"Runtime CSS customization":109,"Native CSS nesting":111,"Open GitHub issues":113},{"value":9,"desc":10},{"value":74,"positive":53,"desc":75},"ALL","HyperUI is framework agnostic and works everywhere",{"value":77,"desc":78},19,"HyperUI has 24 Components, 19 of them are unique – for example pagination and button group are considered as same.",{"value":19,"desc":80},"HyperUI has light and dark themes",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":23},{"value":83,"positive":53,"desc":84},0,"HyperUI doesn't ship JavaScript to browsers",{"value":86,"positive":13,"desc":87},1,"HyperUI has no dependencies, but it requires @tailwindcss/forms plugin",{"value":89,"positive":13,"desc":87},"65kB",{"value":91,"desc":32},12000,{"value":36,"desc":93},"Can't measure",{"value":36,"desc":93},{"value":52,"positive":53,"desc":96},"HyperUI uses Tailwind CSS class names which is available on CDN",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":98},"HyperUI does not use semantic CSS class names. Using semantic and descriptive CSS class names improves readability and maintainability of code independent of the current framework.",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":100},"HyperUI requires changing class names one by one at build time to do customization",{"value":52,"positive":53,"desc":102},"HyperUI does not requires a Node.js environment",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":104},"HyperUI does not provide micro CSS files for each component",{"value":52,"positive":53,"desc":106},"HyperUI uses wide-gamut P3 colors by default",{"value":52,"positive":53,"desc":108},"HyperUI supports right-to-left (RTL) layouts",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":110},"HyperUI customizations requires changing Tailwind CSS class names at build time",{"value":22,"positive":13,"desc":112},"HyperUI doesn not use native CSS nesting",{"value":83,"desc":114},"As of June 2029","hyperui",{"Unique components":117,"Built-in Themes":117,"GitHub stars":117,"Used by open source projects":117,"NPM downloads":117,"Open GitHub issues":118},"more","less",[120,124,127,130,133,136,139,142,143,146,149,152,155,158,161,162],{"key":121,"name":122,"logo":123},"daisyui","daisyUI","\u003Csvg aria-label=\"daisyUI logomark\" viewBox=\"0 0 450 450\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\u003Cg data-name=\"bg\">\u003Cg opacity=\".7\">\u003Cpath d=\"M148.425 40.167c-5.725 8.432-10.275 18.214-13.273 29.347a93.022 93.022 0 0 1-65.638 65.639c-11.133 2.997-20.916 7.547-29.348 13.273-11.952-62.513 45.746-120.21 108.259-108.26Z\" fill=\"#FFD819\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M40.167 148.425c1.914 10.011 5.614 20.146 11.366 30.138a93.022 93.022 0 0 1 0 92.827c-5.752 9.992-9.453 20.126-11.366 30.138-52.654-35.753-52.654-117.35 0-153.103Z\" fill=\"#FFE029\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M148.425 409.786c-5.725-8.432-10.275-18.215-13.273-29.348A93.02 93.02 0 0 0 69.514 314.8c-11.133-2.998-20.916-7.548-29.348-13.274-11.952 62.513 45.746 120.211 108.259 108.26Z\" fill=\"#FFC141\"/>\u003Cpath d=\"M301.528 409.785c-10.011-1.914-20.145-5.614-30.137-11.366a93.021 93.021 0 0 0-92.827 0c-9.992 5.752-20.127 9.453-30.